Comment:
 The file sage/src/doc/en/reference/history_and_license/index.rst contains the incorrect
 statement "All documentation is released under the GNU Free Documentation License."
 This is in contradiction to several statements placing documentation under CC-BY-SA-3.0,
 e.g. in sage/src/doc/en/reference/index.rst.
 This oversight was fixed in the upstream git repo, the reference to the GFDL was removed.
 See
 https://trac.sagemath.org/ticket/22041
 https://git.sagemath.org/sage.git/diff?id=20bd83fbed668c9f7beaad9c1d8c21c95808a785
 https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/sage-devel/78zfWLa1ohE

